 "validity": "<b>Validity of Quotation:</b> All prices are valid for 24 hours after quotation submission and are subject to hotel and room availability as no space has been secured. Prices are quoted for 2 to 3 persons per room; single supplement is RM 250 per person. A deposit of RM 250 per person is required upon confirmation, with full payment due 45 days prior to departure. A late booking surcharge of RM 50 per booking applies to bookings made less than 45 days before the departure date. Private driver and driving guide are on a 12 hours basis per day; 150,000 IDR per hour is charged for every extra hour and must be paid in cash in Medan. Itinerary, price and flight schedule are subject to change. Final itinerary and hotel arrangements will be confirmed 14 days before the trip. Suggested arrival and departure times are at noon; late arrivals or early departures will not be refunded for activities and meals. This package is valid for travel until 31 January 2027. Ground arrangement and tipping only - flight tickets are not included.",
